1
00:00:00,471 --> 00:00:02,301
(Raj:)How hot is it?

2
00:00:02,306 --> 00:00:04,976
(Sheldon:)Uh, let's see.
704?

3
00:00:04,975 --> 00:00:07,375
No, wait, it's on "clock."

4
00:00:07,377 --> 00:00:09,807
No, the real answer
isn't much better.

5
00:00:09,813 --> 00:00:11,943
(Sheldon:)102 degrees.

6
00:00:11,949 --> 00:00:13,379
(Raj:)Well, that's what we wanted.

7
00:00:13,383 --> 00:00:16,123
(Raj:)This is as hot
as the mines will be.
True.

8
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:21,160
(Sheldon:)Sheldon's Mine Simulation Log,
entry one.

9
00:00:21,158 --> 00:00:23,758
(Sheldon:)Koothrappali's restating
of the obvious

10
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:26,430
(Sheldon:)is already getting on my nerves.

11
00:00:28,966 --> 00:00:30,636
(Leonard:)Thanks again
for having us.

12
00:00:30,634 --> 00:00:33,334
(Howard:)Oh, of course. What did
you guys want to talk about?

13
00:00:33,337 --> 00:00:35,337
(Penny:)Well, you know, now
that we're engaged,

14
00:00:35,339 --> 00:00:38,839
(Penny:)we had some questions about how
you handle money as a couple.

15
00:00:38,842 --> 00:00:42,182
(Bernadette:)I told you they weren't gonna
ask us to swing with them.

16
00:00:44,481 --> 00:00:45,811
(Howard:)I didn't think
they were going to.

17
00:00:45,816 --> 00:00:47,416
(Howard:)I just wanted to have
a way to say no

18
00:00:47,417 --> 00:00:49,317
(Howard:)without hurting
Leonard's feelings.

19
00:00:50,487 --> 00:00:53,487
(Leonard:)Well... nailed it.

20
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:54,990
(Howard:)So what did you
want to know?

21
00:00:54,992 --> 00:00:57,922
(Penny:)Well, do you guys ever
fight over money?

